*  metaprogramming-1_driver -- loads metaprogramming-1.sno, a file with no END statement, and ends, so the state the file leaves at load time is graded by the termination dump
*  (the grader 2026-11-18; Lon 2026-11-17: a library file with no main is graded by its driver, a silent program by its dump).
-INCLUDE "metaprogramming-1.sno"
END
